Bandit Level 8 - Level 9

Challenge: Find the unique line.

Solution:

sort data.txt | uniq -u

Explanation:
sort command sorts the file into alphabetical order and put duplicates on the same line
this '|' character pipes the sort command into the next command which is uniq -u
uniq only works on sorted data.
-u only prints unique lines

